:"2026-07-18T14:23"},{"k":"presentation","t":"Investor Presentation","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ICICI2022_18072026163744_NSEBSE_InvestorPresentation.pdf","ts":"2026-07-18T16:37"},{"k":"call","t":"Analysts/Institutional Investor Meet/Con. Call Updates","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ICICI2022_18072026210424_NSEBSE_AudioRecording.pdf","ts":"2026-07-18T21:05"},{"k":"presentation","t":"Investor Presentation","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ICICI2022_22072026064344_NSEBSE_22072026.pdf","ts":"2026-07-22T06:46"},{"k":"transcript","t":"Analysts/Institutional Investor Meet/Con. Call Updates","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ICICI2022_23072026180406_NSEBSE_23072026.pdf","ts":"2026-07-23T18:05"},{"k":"transcript","t":"Analysts/Institutional Investor Meet/Con. Call Updates","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ICICI2022_23072026185521_NSEBSE.pdf","ts":"2026-07-23T18:56"}],"cm":{"items":[{"field":"summary","statement":"The cleanest large private-bank print: core-led PAT +15.9%, NIM expanded to 4.36% while peers compressed, advances +19.6%, GNPA down to 1.38% - execution, not provisioning, drove the beat.","quote":"ICICI Bank Ltd | Q1 FY27 results 18 Jul 2026 | Sector: Private Bank. Compiled from the results release and free earnings-coverage; peer figures from the same-quarter prints. Not a paid transcript feed. 1. The one-line verdict This was the best large private-bank print of the quarter , and importantly it was high-quality: profit growth came from the core (net interest income and strong loan growth)","doc_kind":"concall","kind":"written summary"},{"field":"improved","statement":"Net interest income rose by 12.7% year-on-year to ₹24,384 crore during the quarter.","quote":"Net interest income grew by 12.7% year-on-year to ₹24,384 crore in Q1-2027","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ICICI2022_23072026185521_NSEBSE.pdf","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"improved","statement":"Profit after tax grew by 15.9% year-on-year to ₹14,805 crore in Q1-2027.","quote":"Profit after tax grew by 15.9% year-on-year to ₹14,805 crore in Q1-2027","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ICICI2022_23072026185521_NSEBSE.pdf","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"margins","statement":"Management expects net interest margins to remain range-bound in FY27 provided interest rates do not move.","quote":"Our expectation of NIM is that, in FY27, it should be range-bound assuming no rate movements.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ICICI2022_23072026185521_NSEBSE.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"margins","statement":"Excluding the effect of interest on tax refunds, the bank's net interest margin was 4.28% for the quarter.","quote":"Excluding the benefit of interest on tax refund, the net interest margin would have been 4.28% in this quarter, 4.27% in previous quarter and 4.27% in Ql of last year.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ICICI2022_23072026185521_NSEBSE.pdf","page":27.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"The bank has invested in an enterprise AI platform for developing, hosting, and deploying AI and Generative AI use cases securely.","quote":"The Bank has invested in an enterprise AI platform, which serves as a secure environment for development, hosting and deployment of AI and Generative AI use cases.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ICICI2022_23072026185521_NSEBSE.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"industry","statement":"High-frequency indicators and policy initiatives show that the Indian economy remains resilient despite global economic uncertainties.","quote":"Amidst the global uncertainties, the Indian economy continues to be resilient as reflected by high frequency indicators, backed by various initiatives taken by the policy makers.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ICICI2022_23072026185521_NSEBSE.pdf","page":2.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"The bank intends to focus on micromarkets and customer ecosystems while continuing to operate within its strategic framework.","quote":"Going forward, we will continue to operate within our strategic framework while focussing on micromarkets and ecosystems.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ICICI2022_23072026185521_NSEBSE.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"tone","statement":"positive","quote":"Looking ahead, we see many opportunities to drive risk calibrated profitable growth and grow market share across key segments.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ICICI2022_23072026185521_NSEBSE.pdf","page":23.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"improved","statement":"The bank's profit after tax grew by 15.9% year-on-year to reach 148.05 billion rupees in the first quarter of 2027.","quote":"PAT of US$ 1.56 bn (₹ 148.05 bn) in Q1-2027, representing a strong 15.9% YoY growth","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ICICI2022_22072026064344_NSEBSE_22072026.pdf","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"improved","statement":"The bank's gross non-performing assets ratio improved consistently from 2.16% in fiscal year 2024 to 1.4% in the first quarter of 2027.","quote":"Prudent credit quality GNPA improved consistently from 2.16% in FY2024 to 1.4% in Q1-2027","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ICICI2022_22072026064344_NSEBSE_22072026.pdf","page":9.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capacity","statement":"The bank added 528 branches in fiscal year 2026, bringing the total number of branches to 7,608 as of June 30, 2026.","quote":"528 branches added in FY2026 Total branches were 7,608 at Jun 30, 2026","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://